(2165119, 296923, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  Looks like it could be a frame from one of the movies, you captured the atmosphere and lighting perfectly.  Just two things that bother me with it.  Love the DOF too and the stormtroopers in the backround.  1.  You just barely cut off the right hand, I would have liked it better if you had included it and a small amount of space to boost on the left.  2.  Hard to tell with such a small size image but the focus seems to be more on the voicebox on his chest and not the helmet.<br/> <br/>Anyway, good image, gave it a 7.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  Looks like it could be a frame from one of the movies, you captured the atmosphere and lighting perfectly.  Just two things that bother me with it.  Love the DOF too and the stormtroopers in the backround.  1.  You just barely cut off the right hand, I would have liked it better if you had included it and a small amount of space to boost on the left.  2.  Hard to tell with such a small size image but the focus seems to be more on the voicebox on his chest and not the helmet. Anyway, good image, gave it a 7.', '2006-02-20 05:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
