(2165398, 297629, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, three things that bother me with it though.  1. The overexposure is a little bit too much for me of the left cheek.  2.  I would have liked the tip of the chin to be in the frame, I find it awkward that you cut it off like that.  3.  A lack of catchlights in the eyes make them seem, well not dead but not as alive as they could have been.  Love the makeup and hair though and the attitude the model is showing :)<br/> <br/>6 from me.</td>', 'Nice portrait, three things that bother me with it though.  1. The overexposure is a little bit too much for me of the left cheek.  2.  I would have liked the tip of the chin to be in the frame, I find it awkward that you cut it off like that.  3.  A lack of catchlights in the eyes make them seem, well not dead but not as alive as they could have been.  Love the makeup and hair though and the attitude the model is showing :) 6 from me.', '2006-02-20 09:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
