(2165547, 296526, 12448, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Tapes were the big thing, portable and you could fast forward!  <br/> <br/>The shot is well done, balanced, the tones are set well, the only thing that bothers be is all the debris and marking on the one CD, not exactly sure why you did that but it''s a bit distracting to me on the whole, would have liked to seen it as clean as the others.  As is a 7</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Tapes were the big thing, portable and you could fast forward!   The shot is well done, balanced, the tones are set well, the only thing that bothers be is all the debris and marking on the one CD, not exactly sure why you did that but it''s a bit distracting to me on the whole, would have liked to seen it as clean as the others.  As is a 7', '2006-02-20 11:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2165550, 297775, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but what were you thinking when you put this frame with this shot?  I don´t think I have ever seen a frame steal so much attention from the shot.  Sorry, not trying to offend you, just wanted to explain why I only gave this a 4 even though I think it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Sorry but what were you thinking when you put this frame with this shot?  I don´t think I have ever seen a frame steal so much attention from the shot.  Sorry, not trying to offend you, just wanted to explain why I only gave this a 4 even though I think it meets the challenge.', '2006-02-20 11:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2165552, 296840, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good tones overall but nothing that really jumps out at me and yells 80''s or WOW!  A good stock photo on the plus side and maybe if you had come from the other angle so you could see the front of the guitars it would have more impact for me personally.  A 6</td>', 'Nice shot, good tones overall but nothing that really jumps out at me and yells 80''s or WOW!  A good stock photo on the plus side and maybe if you had come from the other angle so you could see the front of the guitars it would have more impact for me personally.  A 6', '2006-02-20 11:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2165553, 297089, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice capture overall, I like the light to shadow from left to right and the look on the model is very nice.  A good portrait shot on the whole but it doesn''t really say 80''s to me in that sense, this could be from any decade.  A 7</td>', 'Nice capture overall, I like the light to shadow from left to right and the look on the model is very nice.  A good portrait shot on the whole but it doesn''t really say 80''s to me in that sense, this could be from any decade.  A 7', '2006-02-20 11:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2165558, 297245, 12448, '<td valign="top">OMG, that is sweet.  Makes me wonder if it''s real, LOL!  The total clarity of the Delorian compared to the background, especially around the front area suggests that you seperated it on layers and blurred the rest, you can see the tell tale signs around the front area.  Very nice lighting but the angle of the car seems weird to me for some reason.   A 6</td>', 'OMG, that is sweet.  Makes me wonder if it''s real, LOL!  The total clarity of the Delorian compared to the background, especially around the front area suggests that you seperated it on layers and blurred the rest, you can see the tell tale signs around the front area.  Very nice lighting but the angle of the car seems weird to me for some reason.   A 6', '2006-02-20 11:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2165559, 297666, 48739, '<td valign="top">Nice!! Great shot!</td>', 'Nice!! Great shot!', '2006-02-20 11:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2165563, 297549, 27482, '<td valign="top">I do not understand why you put the iso and shutterspeed with the title?  Also, why the strange settings, your subject isn´t going anywhere.  The shot looks underexposed so I would rather reccomend you used settings such as iso 100 and about 1 second, don´t tell me that it´s because you didn´t bring a tripod, that´s no excuse.</td>', 'I do not understand why you put the iso and shutterspeed with the title?  Also, why the strange settings, your subject isn´t going anywhere.  The shot looks underexposed so I would rather reccomend you used settings such as iso 100 and about 1 second, don´t tell me that it´s because you didn´t bring a tripod, that´s no excuse.', '2006-02-20 11:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
