(2165570, 297283, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very clever, very clever indeed and the pacman and dots looks great.  However, the skintones on the baby look to yellow for my taste and also the baby doesn´t appear really tack sharp wich the rest of the shot does.  The outcome is just not really that aesthetically pleasing to me but I still gave it a 6, mostly for the effort you must have put into this shot.</td>', 'Very clever, very clever indeed and the pacman and dots looks great.  However, the skintones on the baby look to yellow for my taste and also the baby doesn´t appear really tack sharp wich the rest of the shot does.  The outcome is just not really that aesthetically pleasing to me but I still gave it a 6, mostly for the effort you must have put into this shot.', '2006-02-20 11:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
