(2166910, 297610, 12448, '<td valign="top">WOW~  Last time I saw that many Atari games in one place was a store, LOL!  Nice idea, the set up is good.  The background has different colors to it, wrinkles or something that just show up and are a bit distracting.  Also there is a hot spot on some of the games in the middle.  A 6</td>', 'WOW~  Last time I saw that many Atari games in one place was a store, LOL!  Nice idea, the set up is good.  The background has different colors to it, wrinkles or something that just show up and are a bit distracting.  Also there is a hot spot on some of the games in the middle.  A 6', '2006-02-20 23:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2166913, 296309, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the other side, the quiet side of the 80''s, like me, hahaha!  Seriously though, very well done, nice composure, good light, though could use just a touch, a tiny touch more contrast for my personal taste.  The hand in the lower right corner is cut off and a bit distracting to me. Other than that, excellent shot.  A 7</td>', 'Very nice, the other side, the quiet side of the 80''s, like me, hahaha!  Seriously though, very well done, nice composure, good light, though could use just a touch, a tiny touch more contrast for my personal taste.  The hand in the lower right corner is cut off and a bit distracting to me. Other than that, excellent shot.  A 7', '2006-02-20 23:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2166923, 297022, 12448, '<td valign="top">Okay, first of all, you NEVER lose the T-shirt, they are with you for life, I know, got several of them myself, LOL!<br/> <br/>Good idea overall, nice concept, good execution on the idea, though the JW is a bit overpowered by the guitar and to me they should be on a more equal basis.  Also the smoke could mean several things, hehehe :)  Nice colors, good lighting overall, a 7</td>', 'Okay, first of all, you NEVER lose the T-shirt, they are with you for life, I know, got several of them myself, LOL! Good idea overall, nice concept, good execution on the idea, though the JW is a bit overpowered by the guitar and to me they should be on a more equal basis.  Also the smoke could mean several things, hehehe :)  Nice colors, good lighting overall, a 7', '2006-02-20 23:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2166929, 297795, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh how many hours I spent playing that game, to get them back.  Good concept for the challenge, nice shot overall, I like the set up, though the "Joystick?" (I think that is what it''s supposed to be) in the middle doesn''t look quite right for some reason, like there should be a ball on the end of it or something.  The angle is a good idea here though the bit of extra black in the upper right is a bit distracting, maybe a slightly tighter crop on that side?  A 7</td>', 'Oh how many hours I spent playing that game, to get them back.  Good concept for the challenge, nice shot overall, I like the set up, though the "Joystick?" (I think that is what it''s supposed to be) in the middle doesn''t look quite right for some reason, like there should be a ball on the end of it or something.  The angle is a good idea here though the bit of extra black in the upper right is a bit distracting, maybe a slightly tighter crop on that side?  A 7', '2006-02-20 23:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2166930, 297589, 12448, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Very cute!  Love the idea and well done overall!  The lighting is lacking though for me, just a bit more "POP" if you will!   :)  A 7</td>', 'LOL!  Very cute!  Love the idea and well done overall!  The lighting is lacking though for me, just a bit more "POP" if you will!   :)  A 7', '2006-02-20 23:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
