(2172363, 296840, 52962, '<td valign="top">very nice picture... like the angle you took it from.  All the wood tones add a warmth to the picture.</td>', 'very nice picture... like the angle you took it from.  All the wood tones add a warmth to the picture.', '2006-02-22 14:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
