(2173437, 297629, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this just looks like a Halloween make-up job to me. It doesn''t feel authentic (this isn''t really what ''original'' punks looked like). Other than the make-up, there isn''t really anything particulalrly 80''s feeling to me about this shot. <br/> <br/>Edited later...I think what I meant to say is I feel this shot is missing the edge the title,and to some degree, the challenge theme) suggests. In terms of portraiture, it is well done.</td>', 'Sorry, this just looks like a Halloween make-up job to me. It doesn''t feel authentic (this isn''t really what ''original'' punks looked like). Other than the make-up, there isn''t really anything particulalrly 80''s feeling to me about this shot.  Edited later...I think what I meant to say is I feel this shot is missing the edge the title,and to some degree, the challenge theme) suggests. In terms of portraiture, it is well done.', '2006-02-22 18:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2173447, 296930, 7322, '<td valign="top">It''s a great photo but I think of this era of Kiss as the 70''s. My recollection of 80''s Kiss is when they took off the make-up. Cool photo, though.</td>', 'It''s a great photo but I think of this era of Kiss as the 70''s. My recollection of 80''s Kiss is when they took off the make-up. Cool photo, though.', '2006-02-22 18:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2173451, 297412, 7322, '<td valign="top">Weirdly reminiscent of my recent Abstract 11 photo (of part of my vinyl collection). I think it could be sharper and it is quite a bit blown out in the  lights. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=291179" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/444/thumb/291179.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/444/thumb/291179.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/444/thumb/291179.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-27 13:13:57.</i></td>', 'Weirdly reminiscent of my recent Abstract 11 photo (of part of my vinyl collection). I think it could be sharper and it is quite a bit blown out in the  lights.  ', '2006-02-22 18:31:02.000000', '2006-02-27 13:13:57.000000', 1),
