(2173464, 297642, 7322, '<td valign="top">To my recollection, they had Snoopy Sno-Cone makers in the 70''s. Anyway, this isn''t too great a photo, sadly. It appears very grainy and the lighting lacks any sort of drama or interest. Everything in the arrangement appears flat because of this. It''s kind of like an eBay photo...all I can say is keep at it.</td>', 'To my recollection, they had Snoopy Sno-Cone makers in the 70''s. Anyway, this isn''t too great a photo, sadly. It appears very grainy and the lighting lacks any sort of drama or interest. Everything in the arrangement appears flat because of this. It''s kind of like an eBay photo...all I can say is keep at it.', '2006-02-22 18:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
