(2178361, 297320, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice image, maybe removing the light at the bottom of the image would help focus attection to the important parts of the image.  Nice shapes and lines though.</td>', 'Nice image, maybe removing the light at the bottom of the image would help focus attection to the important parts of the image.  Nice shapes and lines though.', '2006-02-24 02:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
