(2180982, 297788, 40430, '<td valign="top">What would it look like if the you cropped the top third and get the fuzzy birds out of the image? great color and clarity.</td>', 'What would it look like if the you cropped the top third and get the fuzzy birds out of the image? great color and clarity.', '2006-02-24 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
