(2183171, 297564, 15407, '<td valign="top">Grerat Car ! I have an 88 Turbbo S (Silver Rose Metallic) which is a factory ''ringer''~ one of the 208 that were made for the Escort Cup &amp; the Playboy Cup.  It''s still a great car and runs with the ''Big Dogs''. I really like the compression blur &amp; the sharp focus in the center.  Many of the people that have ridden in mine mention that the effect you''ve captured in the picture is how they felt ridding in it with while I''m instructing them in High Performace driving at the local Roadracing tracks.  Well Done!</td>', 'Grerat Car ! I have an 88 Turbbo S (Silver Rose Metallic) which is a factory ''ringer''~ one of the 208 that were made for the Escort Cup & the Playboy Cup.  It''s still a great car and runs with the ''Big Dogs''. I really like the compression blur & the sharp focus in the center.  Many of the people that have ridden in mine mention that the effect you''ve captured in the picture is how they felt ridding in it with while I''m instructing them in High Performace driving at the local Roadracing tracks.  Well Done!', '2006-02-25 21:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
