(2184334, 297679, 9906, '<td valign="top">Goth is definately not a product of the 80''s.  In fact it wasn''t around untill the mid 90''s.  Goth is a mutation of several scenes that started in the late 70''s through the early 90''s including punk, new wave, heavy metal (not to be confused with the spandex bands of the 80''s) and a bit of Rocky Horror...<br/>TC</td>', 'Goth is definately not a product of the 80''s.  In fact it wasn''t around untill the mid 90''s.  Goth is a mutation of several scenes that started in the late 70''s through the early 90''s including punk, new wave, heavy metal (not to be confused with the spandex bands of the 80''s) and a bit of Rocky Horror...TC', '2006-02-26 12:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
