(2184350, 296930, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot and I''ll give you credit for meeting the challenge but it''s a bit tenous as the 80''s in Kiss history is know as the decade that the boys took off their makeup.  I''ll let it fit into the challenge simply because they actually didn''t take the makeup off in public until 1983.  They never again appeared in makeup until their 1998 reunion tour...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice shot and I''ll give you credit for meeting the challenge but it''s a bit tenous as the 80''s in Kiss history is know as the decade that the boys took off their makeup.  I''ll let it fit into the challenge simply because they actually didn''t take the makeup off in public until 1983.  They never again appeared in makeup until their 1998 reunion tour...TC', '2006-02-26 12:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2184360, 297629, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wrong decade...  Punk rock roots are deep in the 70''s.  Sex Pistols, who were said to be the original punk band came out in 1977 but the true roots began in 75-76...  Nice shot though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Wrong decade...  Punk rock roots are deep in the 70''s.  Sex Pistols, who were said to be the original punk band came out in 1977 but the true roots began in 75-76...  Nice shot though...TC', '2006-02-26 12:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
