(2184386, 297649, 9906, '<td valign="top">I have no idea why you cut her head off...  The simple makeup was what made a Palmer girl a Palmer girl...  You got the dress and thhe guitar down, but without the head I can not give you top scores...  Oh, you got to lose the jewelry too...<br/>TC</td>', 'I have no idea why you cut her head off...  The simple makeup was what made a Palmer girl a Palmer girl...  You got the dress and thhe guitar down, but without the head I can not give you top scores...  Oh, you got to lose the jewelry too...TC', '2006-02-26 13:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
