(2184393, 297588, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure you got your history right unless you are talking Japan...  In the US in 1990 only 28% of homes had a cd in them...  As far as your shot goes, I know what you are trying to do, but this doesn''t go over all that well.  It''s kind of boring and without your title, I wouldn''t even know what it was...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m not sure you got your history right unless you are talking Japan...  In the US in 1990 only 28% of homes had a cd in them...  As far as your shot goes, I know what you are trying to do, but this doesn''t go over all that well.  It''s kind of boring and without your title, I wouldn''t even know what it was...TC', '2006-02-26 13:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
