(2184399, 297604, 9906, '<td valign="top">Put them on vinyl and you would have the eigties nailed.  However with only 28% of households in the US having a cd of any kind in them in 1990, I don''t call that a huge breakthrough...<br/>TC</td>', 'Put them on vinyl and you would have the eigties nailed.  However with only 28% of households in the US having a cd of any kind in them in 1990, I don''t call that a huge breakthrough...TC', '2006-02-26 13:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
