(2185079, 297508, 43774, '<td valign="top">The fall of communism, the fall of the Berlin Wall, but the fall of Coke? I guess cola wars were big in the 80''s but I wasn''t aware that Coke lost. Nice photo.</td>', 'The fall of communism, the fall of the Berlin Wall, but the fall of Coke? I guess cola wars were big in the 80''s but I wasn''t aware that Coke lost. Nice photo.', '2006-02-26 20:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185081, 296836, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good composition, you got the styles of clothing/makeup right on.</td>', 'Good composition, you got the styles of clothing/makeup right on.', '2006-02-26 20:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185082, 297025, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice work, good lighting, clothing and pose. But they didn''t have goatees, just that one day stubble. I guess there''s only so far you''ll go for a photo! :)</td>', 'Nice work, good lighting, clothing and pose. But they didn''t have goatees, just that one day stubble. I guess there''s only so far you''ll go for a photo! :)', '2006-02-26 20:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185083, 296930, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great makeup job</td>', 'Great makeup job', '2006-02-26 20:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185084, 296621, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice layout</td>', 'Nice layout', '2006-02-26 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185091, 297815, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute pose, good colour and choice of clothing for the decade.</td>', 'Cute pose, good colour and choice of clothing for the decade.', '2006-02-26 20:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185092, 297618, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like all the dead space. The model looks great, I''d love to see a closer shot.</td>', 'Not sure I like all the dead space. The model looks great, I''d love to see a closer shot.', '2006-02-26 20:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185093, 295129, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool, would like to know what this is because it looks like a straight poster shot (which I am sure it is not).</td>', 'Cool, would like to know what this is because it looks like a straight poster shot (which I am sure it is not).', '2006-02-26 20:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185097, 297651, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and reflection, good clear shot. I don''t remember those stands in the 80''s.</td>', 'Nice angle and reflection, good clear shot. I don''t remember those stands in the 80''s.', '2006-02-26 20:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185098, 297465, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool setup</td>', 'Cool setup', '2006-02-26 20:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185099, 296388, 43774, '<td valign="top">LOL!! The latest in technology back then, eh? Cute shot.</td>', 'LOL!! The latest in technology back then, eh? Cute shot.', '2006-02-26 20:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185101, 297611, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image is a little dark. You definitely got the styles of clothing and makeup right. I don''t like the placement of the models. At first glance I thought he was spanking her because of the positioning of his hands and because she is bent over. Then I realized he is probably doing that robot dance and she is in that position because you wanted to get the hair flying up. It does look odd.</td>', 'Image is a little dark. You definitely got the styles of clothing and makeup right. I don''t like the placement of the models. At first glance I thought he was spanking her because of the positioning of his hands and because she is bent over. Then I realized he is probably doing that robot dance and she is in that position because you wanted to get the hair flying up. It does look odd.', '2006-02-26 20:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185102, 297679, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good choice of makeup/clothing styles. Lighting could use some work.</td>', 'Good choice of makeup/clothing styles. Lighting could use some work.', '2006-02-26 20:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185103, 297785, 43774, '<td valign="top">You got the clothing/makeup styles right. I don''t like whatever post processing you did, there appear to be faint lines over the entire image.</td>', 'You got the clothing/makeup styles right. I don''t like whatever post processing you did, there appear to be faint lines over the entire image.', '2006-02-26 20:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185104, 297405, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good clear image</td>', 'Good clear image', '2006-02-26 20:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185106, 297428, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute addition of the cabbage leaves.</td>', 'Cute addition of the cabbage leaves.', '2006-02-26 20:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
