(2185109, 297113, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute, looks like the 80''s styles. Entire face is not in focus, or you used too much neat image, something.</td>', 'Cute, looks like the 80''s styles. Entire face is not in focus, or you used too much neat image, something.', '2006-02-26 20:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
