(2185147, 295716, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pose is good, "boom box" is a little small for the 80''s...they were huge back then. (hmmmm, come to think of it, is that a CD player? They would not have existed back in the 80''s in that style)</td>', 'Pose is good, "boom box" is a little small for the 80''s...they were huge back then. (hmmmm, come to think of it, is that a CD player? They would not have existed back in the 80''s in that style)', '2006-02-26 20:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185148, 296923, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice clear picture</td>', 'Nice clear picture', '2006-02-26 20:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185149, 297629, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good job on the look of the model. A little too much neat image, you''ve lost detail in the hair/face.</td>', 'Good job on the look of the model. A little too much neat image, you''ve lost detail in the hair/face.', '2006-02-26 20:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185150, 296890, 43774, '<td valign="top">Never had one of those...certainly looks 80''s though.</td>', 'Never had one of those...certainly looks 80''s though.', '2006-02-26 20:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185151, 297565, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2006-02-26 20:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185153, 297642, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image is a little noisy, better lighting would help.</td>', 'Image is a little noisy, better lighting would help.', '2006-02-26 20:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185154, 297371, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good job, she could pass for Kim Basinger.</td>', 'Good job, she could pass for Kim Basinger.', '2006-02-26 20:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185155, 297283, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, very clear and the colours really pop. Not sure it really says 80''s though, even though pac-man was around then.</td>', 'Cute photo, very clear and the colours really pop. Not sure it really says 80''s though, even though pac-man was around then.', '2006-02-26 20:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185156, 297641, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice photo (now I have that song in my head!).</td>', 'Nice photo (now I have that song in my head!).', '2006-02-26 20:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185157, 297605, 43774, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is, I was not into computers in the 80''s. I would like to see more of it, more DOF and a different angle.</td>', 'I have no idea what this is, I was not into computers in the 80''s. I would like to see more of it, more DOF and a different angle.', '2006-02-26 20:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185158, 297462, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get it. Is she in mourning because The Cure is no longer together? Doesn''t really say 80''s to me. Good photo though.</td>', 'I don''t really get it. Is she in mourning because The Cure is no longer together? Doesn''t really say 80''s to me. Good photo though.', '2006-02-26 20:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185159, 297735, 43774, '<td valign="top">A bit of a bland shot. Certainly tells a lot about the 80''s. Maybe if you had focused on one headline and added more elements relating to it to the photo it would have a greater imapct.</td>', 'A bit of a bland shot. Certainly tells a lot about the 80''s. Maybe if you had focused on one headline and added more elements relating to it to the photo it would have a greater imapct.', '2006-02-26 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185160, 297068, 43774, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t say 80''s to me.</td>', 'Doesn''t say 80''s to me.', '2006-02-26 20:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185161, 297590, 43774, '<td valign="top">So-so job on choice of clothing/makeup for the model. Those huge glasses don''t look good (looks like some sort of head brace actually). Image is a little soft.</td>', 'So-so job on choice of clothing/makeup for the model. Those huge glasses don''t look good (looks like some sort of head brace actually). Image is a little soft.', '2006-02-26 20:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185162, 297530, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice colour but I think most people will be looking for photos from the 1980''s.</td>', 'Nice colour but I think most people will be looking for photos from the 1980''s.', '2006-02-26 20:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185164, 297725, 43774, '<td valign="top">Would like to see better focus and lighting.</td>', 'Would like to see better focus and lighting.', '2006-02-26 20:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185166, 296309, 43774, '<td valign="top">Looks more 70''s to me than 80''s. Hair is not big enough, where is the blue eyeshadow and pink blush?</td>', 'Looks more 70''s to me than 80''s. Hair is not big enough, where is the blue eyeshadow and pink blush?', '2006-02-26 20:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185167, 297132, 43774, '<td valign="top">Yellow curtain is distracting, should have been cropped off. Image is a little dark. Focusing closer on the girl would be better. Her clothing looks like it''s from the 80''s but it''s hard to tell. That phone definitely wasn''t around in the 80''s.</td>', 'Yellow curtain is distracting, should have been cropped off. Image is a little dark. Focusing closer on the girl would be better. Her clothing looks like it''s from the 80''s but it''s hard to tell. That phone definitely wasn''t around in the 80''s.', '2006-02-26 20:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185168, 297822, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the focus. If you didn''t say it was post-it notes I''d think it was sliced cheese (don''t know why I have cheese on my mind!).</td>', 'Not fond of the focus. If you didn''t say it was post-it notes I''d think it was sliced cheese (don''t know why I have cheese on my mind!).', '2006-02-26 20:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185169, 296732, 43774, '<td valign="top">Focus is mostly on the people who don''t seem to fit the 80''s. I see some records and other stuff that could be from the 80''s but your photo is too small to really tell.</td>', 'Focus is mostly on the people who don''t seem to fit the 80''s. I see some records and other stuff that could be from the 80''s but your photo is too small to really tell.', '2006-02-26 20:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185170, 295547, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure how this fits the challenge.', '2006-02-26 20:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185172, 297762, 43774, '<td valign="top">Water is overexposed. I also don''t see how this fits the challenge.</td>', 'Water is overexposed. I also don''t see how this fits the challenge.', '2006-02-26 20:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185173, 297549, 43774, '<td valign="top">Photo is very grainy and dark, better lighting would help but I am assuming you took this in a museum. I''d also say most people are equating this challenge with 1980, not 1880.</td>', 'Photo is very grainy and dark, better lighting would help but I am assuming you took this in a museum. I''d also say most people are equating this challenge with 1980, not 1880.', '2006-02-26 20:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2185174, 297788, 43774, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo but I think it''s a stretch to try and fit it into this challenge.<br/>Back to say I am adding this to my favourites, it''s a stunning photo (but still a stretch to meet the challenge)</td>', 'Gorgeous photo but I think it''s a stretch to try and fit it into this challenge.Back to say I am adding this to my favourites, it''s a stunning photo (but still a stretch to meet the challenge)', '2006-02-26 20:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
