(2185951, 296930, 25355, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon. It''s funny, but to me KISS is very much a band of the 70''s, but I sort of ignored most music from the 80''s. I actually thought they went unmasked only recently...<br/>   You may not know, but the Canon Rebel is called Canon KISS here in Japan. For advertising purposes, they use a quartet of non-Japanese children made-up as the KISS members and they sing "I was made for loving you, baby". Quite cute, in a way.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon. It''s funny, but to me KISS is very much a band of the 70''s, but I sort of ignored most music from the 80''s. I actually thought they went unmasked only recently...   You may not know, but the Canon Rebel is called Canon KISS here in Japan. For advertising purposes, they use a quartet of non-Japanese children made-up as the KISS members and they sing "I was made for loving you, baby". Quite cute, in a way.', '2006-02-27 01:16:48.000000', NULL, 0),
