(2186330, 296930, 28299, '<td valign="top">Wooohoooo, congrats! Let''s face it, if you had done it w/o makeup, it wouldn''t have grabbed much attention, so what you created here is perfect. BTW, what the heck does oi, oi, oi mean????????? I thought it was a Yiddish expression (except that I think that is oy) for being shocked or frustrated. Just can''t be the same thing!!! LOL!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-27 07:08:28.</i></td>', 'Wooohoooo, congrats! Let''s face it, if you had done it w/o makeup, it wouldn''t have grabbed much attention, so what you created here is perfect. BTW, what the heck does oi, oi, oi mean????????? I thought it was a Yiddish expression (except that I think that is oy) for being shocked or frustrated. Just can''t be the same thing!!! LOL!', '2006-02-27 07:07:44.000000', '2006-02-27 07:08:28.000000', 0),
