(2187390, 297618, 33145, '<td valign="top">Man, I''d like to see those people who voted 2,3, and 4 on this shot try and get ANYTHING close to a beautiful shot like this. Voting down an image based purely on possible lack of meeting the challenge EXACTLY is stupid. Anyway - you got the last laugh with this ribbon - good on ya!</td>', 'Man, I''d like to see those people who voted 2,3, and 4 on this shot try and get ANYTHING close to a beautiful shot like this. Voting down an image based purely on possible lack of meeting the challenge EXACTLY is stupid. Anyway - you got the last laugh with this ribbon - good on ya!', '2006-02-27 14:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
