(2196414, 296621, 36238, '<td valign="top">I''ll tell ya, those commodore 64 tape players are hard to come by.  My brother still has the one he and I used back with C64 was in it''s prime, but they are hard to find if you''re out looking for one to buy or otherwise acquire.<br/> <br/>Just for showing that in the photo is amazing to me.</td>', 'I''ll tell ya, those commodore 64 tape players are hard to come by.  My brother still has the one he and I used back with C64 was in it''s prime, but they are hard to find if you''re out looking for one to buy or otherwise acquire. Just for showing that in the photo is amazing to me.', '2006-03-02 17:16:32.000000', NULL, 0),
