(2198122, 296930, 19831, '<td valign="top">Congrats Judi! What an awesome photo :-) <br/>Sure, Kiss maybe wasn''t the dominating powerhouse that they were in the 70''s, but they were definitely alive and well and putting stuff out in the 80''s! They have some of the most rock solid fans there are (try telling any Kiss Army member they weren''t an 80''s band!) And as TC points out, they were still in makeup til 83, and had some hits in the 80''s. The photo is just great though. It reminds me of when the guys all put out a solo album. Maybe a square crop would make it feel like an album cover :-) <br/>Great job! Awesome photo! WTG!!!<br/>:-)</td>', 'Congrats Judi! What an awesome photo :-) Sure, Kiss maybe wasn''t the dominating powerhouse that they were in the 70''s, but they were definitely alive and well and putting stuff out in the 80''s! They have some of the most rock solid fans there are (try telling any Kiss Army member they weren''t an 80''s band!) And as TC points out, they were still in makeup til 83, and had some hits in the 80''s. The photo is just great though. It reminds me of when the guys all put out a solo album. Maybe a square crop would make it feel like an album cover :-) Great job! Awesome photo! WTG!!!:-)', '2006-03-03 13:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
